@startuml
[*] --> TaskCreated
TaskCreated --> InProgress : Start Work
TaskCreated --> OnHold : Pause
InProgress --> OnHold : Pause
InProgress --> DeadlineApproaching : Deadline Near
InProgress --> Completed : Finish
InProgress --> Overdue : Miss Deadline
OnHold --> InProgress : Resume
OnHold --> Completed : Finish
OnHold --> Overdue : Miss Deadline
DeadlineApproaching --> Completed : Finish
DeadlineApproaching --> Overdue : Miss Deadline
Completed --> [*] : Done
Overdue --> [*] : Overdue
@enduml
